const __buildAlertsV35Base=buildAlerts;buildAlerts=function(){const base=__buildAlertsV35Base(),extra=currentSafetyV35().map(r=>({type:r.sev==='critical'?'critical':'interaction',kicker:'SAFETY ENGINE',title:r.title,text:r.text,chips:r.tags,sourceUrl:r.source.url}));const seen=new Set(),out=[];for(const a of [...base,...extra]){const k=(a.title||'')+'|'+(a.text||'');if(!seen.has(k)){seen.add(k);out.push(a)}}return out};

